# IslandCraft - Equipment of Arrakis. One section per module.

# ---- core
commands.arrakis.desc = Equipment of Arrakis commands (operators only): modules, selfcheck, worldtest, power
commands.arrakis.modules.desc = Lists the modules, whether each is enabled and how its setup went.
commands.arrakis.selfcheck.desc = Re-runs every module's self-check and prints the lines.
commands.arrakis.worldtest.desc = Development: writes and reads a block at 0, 200, 0 through the world access helper.

# ---- power
commands.arrakis.power.desc = Power (the Mana stat): get, set, add, fill, spend, max, modifier, selftest
commands.arrakis.power.get.desc = Shows Mana, the max, the fraction, the game mode and the max modifiers: arrakis power get [player]
commands.arrakis.power.set.desc = Sets Mana, clamped to 0 and the max: arrakis power set <n> [player]
commands.arrakis.power.add.desc = Adds to Mana (negative takes), clamped: arrakis power add <n> [player]
commands.arrakis.power.fill.desc = Fills Mana to its max: arrakis power fill [player]
commands.arrakis.power.spend.desc = Spends Mana all or nothing and says if it was refused; creative spends nothing: arrakis power spend <n> [player]
commands.arrakis.power.max.desc = Shows the max and its modifiers: arrakis power max [player]
commands.arrakis.power.modifier.desc = Max-Mana modifiers: add, remove, list
commands.arrakis.power.modifier.add.desc = Adds a modifier to the max, same id replaces: arrakis power modifier add <id> <add|mul> <amount> [player]
commands.arrakis.power.modifier.remove.desc = Removes a modifier: arrakis power modifier remove <id> [player]
commands.arrakis.power.modifier.list.desc = Lists the modifiers on the max: arrakis power modifier list [player]
commands.arrakis.power.selftest.desc = Development: runs the power checks on a test dummy.

